he-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":7,"open_issues":17,"watchers":7,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/DataDesignerPlugins/pulls/88","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/DataDesignerPlugins/pull/88","diff_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/DataDesignerPlugins/pull/88.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/DataDesignerPlugins/pull/88.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\n- remove NLTK from the retrieval SDG plugin and workspace lockfile so the reported NLTK vulnerabilities are no longer present in installed environments\n- replace Punkt sentence tokenization with a bounded, dependency-free scanner that preserves punctuation, common abbreviations, decimals, closing quotes, paragraph boundaries, and Unicode terminators\n- remove runtime tokenizer downloads and add regression coverage for the replacement behavior\n\nNLTK 3.10.3 is currently the latest published release, while CVE-2026-81726 lists all versions through 3.10.3 as affected with no patched release. Removing the dependency addresses the full attached report rather than leaving that advisory unresolved.\n\n## Linked Issue\n\nRepository collaborator performing routine security maintenance; no linked issue.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `make sync`\n- `make lint`\n- `make test`\n- `make validate`\n- `make check`\n- `make all`\n- verified the isolated retrieval-plugin environment does not contain NLTK\n- exercised the scanner with a 200,000-character sentence\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Linked to the open, triaged issue this PR addresses (`Fixes #NNN` or `Closes #NNN`), or I am a repository collaborator performing routine maintenance or already-planned work\n- [x] Follows the template structure (`config.py`, `impl.py`, `plugin.py`) if adding a plugin (not applicable; no plugin added)\n- [x] `assert_valid_plugin(plugin)` passes\n- [x] Unit tests included and passing (`make test-plugin PLUGIN=<name>`)\n- [x] Plugin installs standalone (`uv pip install -e plugins/<plugin-dir>`)\n- [x] Plugin docs regenerated if plugin docs, list, or metadata changed (`make plugin-docs`)\n- [x] Documentation builds if docs changed (`make docs`)\n- [x] `catalog/plugins.json` updated only if preparing a first release (`make catalog PLUGIN=<name>`; not applicable)\n- [x] `.github/CODEOWNERS` regenerated if ownership changed (`make codeowners`; not applicable)\n- [x] Per-plugin `CODEOWNERS` file included (auto-created by `ddp new`)\n- [x] NVIDIA SPDX headers on all files (`make check-license-headers`)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/DataDesignerPlugins/issues/88/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/DataDesignerPlugins/issues/88/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]]
